# Laravel (detect: `artisan` + `composer.json` တွင် `laravel/framework`)

FastAPI = `05` · Node/Express = `10`။

- Surface `backend`/`fullstack`။ Routes/Controllers/Migrations/Eloquent = Laravel conventions။
- DB = Eloquent/Query Builder parameterized — raw concat SQL မဆောက်။
- AuthZ = policies/gates/middleware။ Form/state-changing → CSRF (`@csrf`/VerifyCsrfToken)။
- Validation = Form Request / validator။ Secrets = `.env` + `config()` — hardcode မလုပ်။
- Test = `phpunit` / `pest` ရှိရင် Testing Gate (`07`) အတိုင်း။
